"Golden wheat, rippling gently in the breeze, surrounds you in this picturesque field. Sitting in the southern end of the field is a windmill, its vanes shimmering in the bright sunlight. To the northeast is the jetty, to the north and northwest, scrub, and a wood lies westward",
"From here, the hill you are on looks more like a mountain as the slopes above are covered in a thick blanket of snow. There is an opening leading west into the hill, shrouded in seemingly impenetrable darkness. To the east lies a region of scrub and southward is a wood",
"is made of thick planks of Kerovnian Oak. Large metal studs (each stamped with the Grunchkev Industries logo) hold the planks together",
"With only those items necessary for making bread and an easy chair to relax in during those quiet moments, the mill seems sparsely furnished",
"The gatehouse is a tall, airy room built from large blocks of stone. The drawbridge leads to the south, and another exit leads north. A lever in the south wall is used to raise and lower the drawbridge",
"This is the gatekeeper's room which smells rather strongly of feet. Amongst the general mess a small bed stands against the far wall, opposite the room's only exit north",
"The servant's quarters are sparsely furnished and a trifle on the cold side. An antique cabinet stands against one wall and there are exits leading north and south",
