"All visitors are brought to this entrance hall on arrival at the castle. The floor is covered with a vast rug, woven in traditional Kerovnian style, and a wooden staircase leads up to the top floor. There are also exits in all four walls; north,south,east and west",
"The courtyard, open to the clear sky above, has ivy trailing hither and thither over the walls. There are openings in the north and south walls which lead to the entrance hall and gatehouse respectively",
